      "writtenOn": "2015-05-08T04:03:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With our new power states, I don\u0027t think we want to force the code into G3. The lowest we want to go is Deep Sx. I have asked Intel about the best way to force the code into this state from the EC. Reading the PDG, I\u0027m not sure if asserting RSMRST# is the best way to do this.",
