      "writtenOn": "2015-05-08T16:36:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s convenient to still call it \"G3\" for now (we have some higher level code / constants that deals with G3 state) even if we\u0027re not really putting the AP into G3. We can consider a refactor later once we figure out what we actually need (deep sx in addition to G3? or instead of G3?)",
      "parentUuid": "4d8435cc_4c5cbca8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 0,
